BoomMineRocks1
    Events
        Unit - A unit Acquires an item
    Conditions
        (Unit-type of (Triggering unit)) Equal to ItemDropLocation
        (Item-type of (Item being manipulated)) Equal to Barrel of Explosives
        (BoomMineRocks1 <gen> contains (Triggering unit)) Equal to True
    Actions
        Trigger - Turn off (This trigger)
        -------- Create Barrel unit --------
        Item - Remove (Item being manipulated)
        Set VariableSet BoomMinePoint = (Position of (Triggering unit))
        Unit - Create 1 Barrel of Explosives for Player 1 (Red) at BoomMinePoint facing Default building facing degrees
        Set VariableSet BoomMineBarrel = (Last created unit)
        -------- Start countdown and timer to destroy the rocks --------
        Countdown Timer - Start BoomMineTimerRock as a One-shot timer that will expire in 15.00 seconds
        Trigger - Turn on BoomMineRocks1 Destroy <gen>
        -------- --- --------
        Set VariableSet BoomMineCountdown = 15
        Trigger - Turn on BoomMineRocks Floating Text <gen>
